# PROJECT: MATH LADDER — CLASS RACE
## Multiplayer Integer Mathematics Classroom Game

Build a complete, functional, responsive, real-time multiplayer educational web game called **Math Ladder: Class Race**.

This application is a multiplayer digital snakes-and-ladders game designed for high school students to practice basic integer arithmetic operations. A teacher hosts a game room, students join using a room code, and all students play simultaneously in synchronized rounds.

This must be a REAL FUNCTIONAL APPLICATION, not just a static mockup, UI concept, or simulated multiplayer experience.

