## B. Operand Range

Allow teacher to configure the first and second operand independently.

Operand A:
- Minimum value
- Maximum value

Operand B:
- Minimum value
- Maximum value

Default configuration:

- Operand A: −20 to 20
- Operand B: −20 to 20

