Difficulty must influence question generation, not just the visual label.

## E. Game Settings

Teacher can configure:

- Number of rounds: 10, 15, 20, 30, 40, or custom
- Answer timer: 5, 10, 15, 20, or 30 seconds
- Wrong-answer penalty
- Dice mode
- Board size
- Number of snakes
- Number of ladders
